				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-74e9ce6 elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="74e9ce6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Event Venues</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3502a02 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3502a02" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The New York Café—the „most beautiful café in the world”—is the perfect place to welcome guests, while the New York Palace, located in the same building, provides the ideal setting for professional meetings and large-scale events.</span></p>								</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-369584f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="369584f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
