					<div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Premium Event Venue </div>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bc3ebbe elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bc3ebbe" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">In the heart of Budapest</div>				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-171030d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="171030d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e507718 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="e507718" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Discover the New York Palace <br>the world of events</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-da76902 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="da76902" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our twelve event spaces, which come in various sizes and can be flexibly combined, are ideal for private </span>from the conference room<br /> From the impressive ballroom to versatile venue options, it can accommodate up to 500 guests. Dedicated <br />Our event planning team coordinates the entire planning process, from the technical aspects <br />from the event concept all the way to the creation of a personalized food and beverage menu.</p>								</div>
