					<div class="ekit-wid-con" ><div class="ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-"><h2 class="ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title">An inspiring and premium environment </h2>				<div class='ekit-heading__description'>
					<p>The New York Palota’s versatile event venues are ideal for a wide range of events, from small business meetings to conferences with hundreds of attendees. Our professional team will tailor every event to your needs and execute it to the highest standards.</p>
