					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Above the world's most beautiful coffeehouse, modern <br>There are rooms with this layout</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b3074c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="8b3074c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1417" height="945" src="https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-4570" alt="" srcset="https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12.webp 1417w, https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-300x200.webp 300w, https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1417px) 100vw, 1417px" />															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2a94eb2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2a94eb2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The New York Palace is one of Budapest’s best-known and most impressive historic buildings, and for more than 130 years it has been an iconic venue for the city’s elegance and social elite.</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The event rooms on the first floor of the building combine classic architectural values with all the technical and comfort requirements of modern business events.</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The venue offers 12 event rooms of various sizes, that can be flexibly combined, providing a fitting setting for a wide range of events—from small executive meetings to conferences with hundreds of attendees and even large-scale gala dinners.</span></p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c2d4323 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="c2d4323" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="534" src="https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-1024x683.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-4570" alt="" srcset="https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-300x200.webp 300w, https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12-768x512.webp 768w, https://newyorkpalota.hu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/new-york-palota-rendezvenytermek-roma-terem-slider-12.webp 1417w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
					</div>
