					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Request a personalized quote for your event</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52f11219 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="52f11219" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Please provide the expected number of guests, the date, and the type of event, and our event planning team will prepare a customized proposal and help you find the venue, room layout, and catering options that best suit your event.</p><p>The request-for-quote form can be used for events with more than 10 people. This form is not suitable for making table reservations.</p><p>If you have any questions, please feel free to call our event planners at <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #a08f84;"><a style="color: #a08f84; text-decoration: underline;" href="tel:+36 1 88 66 134">+36 1 88 66 134</a></span></span> by phone.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-17aa41ac elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider" data-id="17aa41ac" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="divider.default">
