		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f509c34 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="f509c34" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-83a0578 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="83a0578" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b586afb elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b586afb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55197ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="55197ed" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We've compiled a list of the most frequently asked questions and answers about the events.</span></p>								</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-801b13f e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="801b13f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bd9deb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bd9deb9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Do you have any other questions?</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3b034ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3b034ea" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our event planning team is happy to assist you and provide personalized guidance to help bring your ideas to life.</span></p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-46de612 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="46de612" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="#form">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Contact Us</span>
					</span>
					</a>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-41b7ac6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="41b7ac6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-626c97b elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="626c97b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default">
							<div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Press Enter or the Space bar to open links, press Escape to close them, and use the arrow keys to navigate.">
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1030" class="e-n-accordion-item" open>
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1030" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> What is the maximum capacity of the events they host? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1030" class="elementor-element elementor-element-e8147c1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e8147c1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5e10280 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5e10280" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The New York Palota’s event spaces offer flexible venue solutions ranging from exclusive business meetings for a minimum of 15 people to large-scale events accommodating up to 500 guests. The exact capacity varies depending on the selected room, the planned program, and the desired layout.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1031" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="2" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1031" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> How can you choose the event space that best suits the occasion? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1031" class="elementor-element elementor-element-2b2c33d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2b2c33d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-caa34b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="caa34b3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our event planning team will help you select the most suitable venue based on the type of event, expected number of attendees, program, planned duration, and technical and catering requirements. If necessary, they will also prepare a customized proposal for the combined use of multiple rooms or an adjoining foyer.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1032" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="3" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1032" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> What types of room layouts are available to choose from? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1032" class="elementor-element elementor-element-7af2fb0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7af2fb0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3de1a27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3de1a27" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Depending on the characteristics of the event hall, we can arrange the seating in a theater-style, classroom-style, U-shape, conference-style, round-table, or standing reception layout. In every case, we tailor the final layout to the event’s program, number of attendees, and catering concept.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1033" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="4" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1033" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can the event rooms be connected to one another? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1033" class="elementor-element elementor-element-640c20a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="640c20a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a8299b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a8299b3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. Some of our event rooms and foyers can be connected to one another, allowing us to create multi-room events, parallel sessions, workshops, exhibitions, or separate reception and catering areas. Our staff will help you plan the optimal layout for your event.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1034" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="5" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1034" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Are the venues suitable for hosting conferences and concurrent programs? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1034" class="elementor-element elementor-element-fb3f6f5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="fb3f6f5" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e572322 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e572322" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. The rooms at the New York Palace are suitable for hosting plenary sessions, smaller breakout sessions, workshops, and business meetings simultaneously. The interconnected rooms and shared lobby areas allow participants to move around comfortably and seamlessly.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1035" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="6" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1035" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Do the event rooms have natural light and the option to darken the room? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1035" class="elementor-element elementor-element-c78e5e5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c78e5e5" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7fca6ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7fca6ac" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lighting conditions and blackout options vary by room. Our selection includes rooms with natural light as well as rooms that can be completely darkened, so you can choose a venue suitable for presentations, film screenings, conferences, and evening events alike.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1036" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="7" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1036" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can the event venues be viewed online? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1036" class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b19b6f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7b19b6f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6db1ab0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6db1ab0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. You can view several of our event spaces through an interactive virtual tour, which will give you a more detailed picture of the spaces’ design, atmosphere, and layout options.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1037" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="8" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1037" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can I request an in-person site visit? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1037" class="elementor-element elementor-element-d76e798 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="d76e798" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9229890 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9229890" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Of course. Upon prior appointment, our event planning team will arrange a personal site visit during which they will show you the available venues and discuss in detail the event’s setup, technical, and catering options.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1038" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="9" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1038" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can catering and event equipment be provided for the rooms? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1038" class="elementor-element elementor-element-8d4f26c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8d4f26c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-edea979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="edea979" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. In addition to the event hall, you can also order a customized food and beverage selection as well as professional technical support. Our in-house event technology team can assist with the planning and implementation of sound systems, lighting, projection equipment, and audiovisual solutions, among other services.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-1039" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="10" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-1039" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can an outside event technology service provider be hired? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1039" class="elementor-element elementor-element-856a071 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="856a071" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0fdae8e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0fdae8e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The New York Palace has its own, exclusive event technology services. It may be possible to engage an external technology service provider upon prior agreement and for an additional fee.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-10310" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="11" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-10310" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Is there parking available near the event venue? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_right-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="arrow_left-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-10310" class="elementor-element elementor-element-aa98e3f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="aa98e3f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-659c758 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="659c758" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. The Anantara New York Palace Budapest Hotel’s indoor parking garage is accessible from Osváth Street. Parking is subject to a fee, so for larger events, we recommend coordinating the expected number of vehicles with our event planning team in advance.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</details>
					</div>
