                "text": "Yes. The Anantara New York Palace Budapest Hotel\u2019s indoor parking garage is accessible from Osv\u00e1th Street. Parking is subject to a fee, so for larger events, we recommend coordinating the expected number of vehicles with our event planning team in advance."
            }
        }
    ]
}</script>
