									<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The New York Palace is a member of the Eventrend Group. Founded in 1992, the Eventrend Group—with decades of experience—is one of the best-known and most respected independent, 100% Hungarian-owned corporate groups in the domestic hospitality, event planning, and hotel management. As a member of the group, we strive to enrich people’s lives with memorable, joyful, and lifelong moments.</span></p>								</div>
